meta {
  name: 6. Create Funding Quote
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{cardId}}/funding-quote
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "amountNgn": 10000
  }
}

docs {
  The user chooses how much NGN to convert. The response states the exact USD
  amount the card receives and the total NGN wallet debit.

  Display `quote.exchangeRate`. It is the BillXpress customer rate and already
  includes the configured funding exchange markup. The raw Maplerad rate is
  admin-only.
}
